\title{nbzinbreg: Negative Binomial and Zero-Inflated Negative Binomial Regression}
\description{
Fits negative binomial (NB2) regression by iteratively reweighted least squares (IRLS) for the regression coefficients, alternated with Newton-Raphson for the dispersion parameter, and zero-inflated negative binomial regression by an EM algorithm whose M-steps are IRLS fits. No general-purpose optimizer is used. Results are checked against the reference implementations in 'MASS' and 'pscl'.
